$MDESC::Type = "CTF Community Maps";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture The Flag" @
	"\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Tombaugh V" @
	"\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Hazy" @
	"\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @
	"\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	"\n\n<f1>Briefing: <f0> Your remember Dangerous Crossing, right? Well, it appears that those dropships were damaged worse than anyone thought. They eventually weren't able to withstand any more abuse and both of them finally bit the dust. You and your enemys both manage to steal technology from each other and build two amazing and new bases from the ground up, with a taste of the past.\n\n<f1> Map Re-Created by -|DA|- Jumper who would have never considered doing this map without Etnies pushing me.  Thanks also to HarvesTime for helping with ideas and support. Gentlemen, you're the best! Thank you! This map took us about 4 hours to create on the evening of Jan. 5, 2003.<f0>";